start": 9.211, "end": 9.991, "text": "Please have a seat."}, {"start": 10.412, "end": 11.532, "text": "What can I help you with today?"}, {"start": 12.072, "end": 13.473, "text": "I need my prescriptions renewed."}, {"start": 13.893, "end": 16.535, "text": "The asthma medicine and the one for stomach acid."}, {"start": 17.075, "end": 17.535, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 18.036, "end": 20.437, "text": "Before we do that, has anything new turned up?"}, {"start": 20.777, "end": 21.798, "text": "Any new symptoms?"}, {"start": 22.398, "end": 23.639, "text": "No, nothing new."}, {"start": 24.379, "end": 24.919, "text": "Should there be?"}, {"start": 24.939, "end": 27.641, "text": "I do worry about the asthma sometimes."}, {"start": 28.221, "end": 29.862, "text": "That is a fair thing to wonder about."}, {"start": 30.314, "end": 32.495, "text": "Nothing you have described today points to something new."}, {"start": 33.115, "end": 35.155, "text": "It is the allergic kind of asthma I have."}, {"start": 35.355, "end": 35.936, "text": "Is that right?"}, {"start": 36.476, "end": 37.856, "text": "Yes, allergic asthma."}, {"start": 38.256, "end": 39.637, "text": "That is the condition we are treating."}, {"start": 40.197, "end": 42.917, "text": "I just want to be sure it is not quietly getting worse."}, {"start": 43.518, "end": 47.339, "text": "Then let us listen to your chest and your heart, and we will know more about today."}, {"start": 47.899, "end": 48.859, "text": "Yes, please do."}, {"start": 49.379, "end": 50.479, "text": "Breathe normally for me."}, {"start": 51.08, "end": 51.76, "text": "And once more."}, {"start": 52.42, "end": 53.34, "text": "Is everything all right?"}, {"start": 53.82, "end": 55.921, "text": "Your lungs and your heart both sound normal."}, {"start": 56.341, "end": 57.661, "text": "Nothing abnormal on listening."}, {"start": 58.582, "end": 59.762, "text": "That is a relief to hear."}, {"start": 60.446, "end": 62.768, "text": "I would describe this as a stable situation."}, {"start": 63.248, "end": 65.23, "text": "You do need to continue the treatment you were on."}, {"start": 65.83, "end": 68.653, "text": "So I carry on with everything exactly as before?"}, {"start": 69.293, "end": 70.434, "text": "Exactly as before."}, {"start": 70.975, "end": 72.956, "text": "And I will renew both prescriptions today."}, {"start": 73.537, "end": 74.537, "text": "Which ones will that be?"}, {"start": 75.138, "end": 78.0, "text": "Dimista and esomeprazole for the stomach acid."}, {"start": 78.501, "end": 79.161, "text": "Both renewed."}, {"start": 79.662, "end": 80.182, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 80.682, "end": 81.963, "text": "That is what I was hoping for."}, {"start": 82.504, "end": 84.385, "text": "Did you notice the first frost this morning?"}, {"start": 84.906, "end": 85.346, "text": "I did."}, {"start": 85.827, "end": 87.608, "text": "The car windows were completely white."}, {"start": 88.248, "end": 90.07, "text": "Autumn has made its point rather firmly."}, {"start": 90.27, "end": 90.71, "text": "It has."}, {"start": 91.491, "end": 93.933, "text": "Right, so I only need to collect the medicine."}, {"start": 94.654, "end": 95.194, "text": "That is all."}, {"start": 95.635, "end": 96.775, "text": "Anything else before you go?"}, {"start": 97.516, "end": 99.037, "text": "No, I think that is everything."}, {"start": 99.318, "end": 100.038, "text": "Thank you, doctor."}, {"start": 100.679, "end": 101.559, "text": "Take care, Birta."}, {"start": 101.76, "end": 102.12, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.071}}